WEBVTT

00:14:58.496 --> 00:15:01.787
I can handle extreme crises
and difficult situations,

00:15:01.787 --> 00:15:05.829
whereas if I'm a software engineer
in Silicon Valley or I'm a trader

00:15:05.829 --> 00:15:09.329
on Wall Street, I haven't been able to
demonstrate my strength in the same way

00:15:09.329 --> 00:15:10.662
as that is. Is that what
you're getting at?

00:15:11.079 --> 00:15:13.746
Yeah, I mean, it's what I'm getting at
because, I mean, it's totally what I get.

00:15:13.787 --> 00:15:17.287
I'm getting that because I'm thinking
to this moment where I'm on

00:15:17.287 --> 00:15:18.954
an Air Force base, talking to a general,

00:15:18.954 --> 00:15:21.454
doing a lot of work with and
these are like serious,

00:15:21.454 --> 00:15:24.704
serious ass people like these are fighter
pilot kind of folks. Right.

00:15:25.162 --> 00:15:28.537
And before we got started, he and
I are talking about the work.

00:15:28.537 --> 00:15:29.204
And I said, you know, one of

00:15:29.246 --> 00:15:33.162
the things that's going to be really
interesting is I want to talk about care